{
  "info": {
    "name": "formly-prize-engine",
    "description": "API v1. Flujo: 1 Create Prize → 2 Get Prize (copiar prizeId) → 3 Add Entry → 4 List Entries → 5 Close → 6 Distribute → 7 Result. USDC/XLM: 8–9 Payment Intent, 10–11 Jobs Tick, 12–12b Verify payment, 13 Pay to wallet. Deposits: 14 by payer, 15 did payer pay this prize. Variables: baseUrl, serviceToken, prizeId, payer.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000" },
    { "key": "serviceToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "prizeId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "payer", "value": "GCT7D6S5VTFGEURS6ZYIO33YZRPQMA3LNWB4GEOHDFDXZGWTA4EPIM5E" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Create Prize (POINTS)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{serviceToken}}" }
        ],
        "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"rewardType\": \"POINTS\",\n  \"distributionMode\": \"SPLIT_EQUAL\",\n  \"prizeAmount\": \"60.0000000\",\n  \"closeAt\": \"2025-03-01T12:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"drawAt\": \"2025-03-02T12:00:00.000Z\"\n}" },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prizes",
        "description": "Paso 1. Crea un prize POINTS (queda en estado LOCKED). De la respuesta copia prizeId a la variable de colección prizeId."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Get Prize",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{serviceToken}}" }],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prizes/{{prizeId}}",
        "description": "Paso 2. Comprueba el prize. Asegúrate de tener prizeId en la variable (si no, cópialo del paso 1)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Add Entry",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{serviceToken}}" }
        ],
        "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"walletAddress\": \"GCT7D6S5VTFGEURS6ZYIO33YZRPQMA3LNWB4GEOHDFDXZGWTA4EPIM5E\",\n  \"sourceId\": \"resp_01\"\n}" },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prizes/{{prizeId}}/entries",
        "description": "Paso 3. Añade una entry al prize (prize en PENDING o LOCKED)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "4. List Entries",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{serviceToken}}" }],
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prizes/{{prizeId}}/entries?limit=20", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "prizes", "{{prizeId}}", "entries"], "query": [{ "key": "limit", "value": "20" }, { "key": "cursor", "value": "", "disabled": true }] },
        "description": "Paso 4. Lista entries (opcional, para verificar)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Close Prize",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{serviceToken}}" }
        ],
        "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{}" },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prizes/{{prizeId}}/close",
        "description": "Paso 5. Obligatorio antes de Distribute. Pasa el prize de LOCKED → CLOSED. (Prize POINTS ya viene LOCKED al crear; si creaste USDC está PENDING y close fallará hasta que esté LOCKED.)"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Distribute",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{serviceToken}}" }
        ],
        "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{}" },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prizes/{{prizeId}}/distribute",
        "description": "Paso 6. Ejecutar solo después de Close. El prize debe estar CLOSED y drawAt debe haber pasado. Si recibes 409 LOCKED: otro distribute tiene el lock (~60s) o no cerraste el prize; espera y reintenta o verifica que ejecutaste paso 5."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "7. Result",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{serviceToken}}" }],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prizes/{{prizeId}}/result",
        "description": "Paso 7. Ver resultado y ganadores después de Distribute."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "8. Create Prize (USDC)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{serviceToken}}" }
        ],
        "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"rewardType\": \"USDC\",\n  \"distributionMode\": \"LOTTERY_SINGLE\",\n  \"prizeAmount\": \"100.0000000\",\n  \"feeBps\": 1000,\n  \"closeAt\": \"2025-03-01T12:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"drawAt\": \"2025-03-02T12:00:00.000Z\"\n}" },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prizes",
        "description": "Alternativa: crear prize USDC (queda PENDING; close solo permite LOCKED→CLOSED)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "9. Create Payment Intent",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{serviceToken}}" }
        ],
        "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"creatorPublicKey\": \"GCT7D6S5VTFGEURS6ZYIO33YZRPQMA3LNWB4GEOHDFDXZGWTA4EPIM5E\"\n}" },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prizes/{{prizeId}}/payment-intent",
        "description": "Genera un Payment Intent (unsigned XDR) para prize XLM/USDC en PENDING. Requiere creatorPublicKey (G...). El core firma y envía la XDR a Stellar."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "10. Jobs Tick execute",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{serviceToken}}" }
        ],
        "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"runMode\": \"execute\",\n  \"maxPrizes\": 50\n}" },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs/tick"
      },
      "description": "Job tick REAL: verifica depósitos Horizon (PRIZE_VAULT), memo+asset+amounts; marca LOCKED con lockRef."
    },
    {
      "name": "11. Jobs Tick dry_run",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{serviceToken}}" }
        ],
        "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"runMode\": \"dry_run\",\n  \"maxPrizes\": 50\n}" },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs/tick"
      },
      "description": "Misma lógica sin escribir DB (no markLocked)."
    },
    {
      "name": "12. Verify payment (txHash)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{serviceToken}}" }
        ],
        "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"txHash\": \"76957cb068d6b9addc59dc41ca11c27680e16b703c92cb302ca000e555ef6fe3\"\n}" },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prizes/{{prizeId}}/verify-payment"
      },
      "description": "Verifica un pago por hash de transacción. Body: { txHash }. Si la tx tiene memo y montos correctos (prize_net + fee), marca el prize como LOCKED."
    },
    {
      "name": "12b. Verify payment (scan vault)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{serviceToken}}" }
        ],
        "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{}" },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prizes/{{prizeId}}/verify-payment"
      },
      "description": "Una verificación: lista txs recientes del vault y busca una que coincida con este prize. El caller hace polling a este endpoint. Body: {}."
    },
    {
      "name": "13. Pay to wallet",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{serviceToken}}" }
        ],
        "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"destination\": \"GCT7D6S5VTFGEURS6ZYIO33YZRPQMA3LNWB4GEOHDFDXZGWTA4EPIM5E\",\n  \"amount\": \"9.0000000\",\n  \"asset\": \"USDC\"\n}" },
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prizes/{{prizeId}}/pay"
      },
      "description": "Envía desde el vault a una wallet. Body: destination (G...), amount, asset (XLM | USDC). asset debe coincidir con el rewardType del prize. Requiere PRIZE_VAULT_SECRET_KEY."
    },
    {
      "name": "14. Deposits by payer",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{serviceToken}}" }],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/deposits?payer={{payer}}&limit=50",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "deposits"],
          "query": [
            { "key": "payer", "value": "{{payer}}" },
            { "key": "limit", "value": "50" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "description": "Lista depósitos registrados para una wallet (quién pagó). Respuesta: paid, totalAmount, deposits[]. Variable: payer (G...)."
    },
    {
      "name": "15. Did payer pay this prize?",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{serviceToken}}" }],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prizes/{{prizeId}}/deposits?payer={{payer}}",
          "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
          "path": ["api", "v1", "prizes", "{{prizeId}}", "deposits"],
          "query": [{ "key": "payer", "value": "{{payer}}" }]
        }
      },
      "description": "¿Esta wallet pagó este premio? Respuesta: paid, amount, amountTotal, txHash?, ledgerAt?. Si no: paid=false, amount=\"0\", amountTotal=\"0\"."
    }
  ]
}
